  "notes": [
    "Fully regular -AR verb; no spelling changes or stem changes",
    "Past participle: *contestado*",
    "*contestar (a) algo* = to answer something (*Contesta la pregunta* — Answer the question)",
    "*contestar al teléfono* = to answer the phone",
    "*contestar un mensaje/correo* = to reply to a message/email",
    "*contestar a alguien* = to talk back to someone (*No me contestes así* — Don't talk back to me like that)",
    "Synonym: *responder* (slightly more formal)",
    "Related: *la contestación* = answer, reply; *el contestador (automático)* = answering machine"
  ],
